                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having the form of a fractal; having to do with fractals."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "37e95fc0-b9e9-4166-a65a-deb7df84d73a",
                                                "sense_id": "9e5efd58-5156-324c-a6fc-3e915c6ea79c",
                                                "text": "Romanesco was my gateway cauli and I've never stopped growing it. Not a variety as much as its own thing, Romanesco is a cauliflower to the French, a calabrese to the Italians. […] Visually, it may be the most remarkable thing you can grow: it is made up of lime-green mini-spirals that coil around themselves in fractal formation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
